<<
/ActualText (Google Certified UI/UX Designer with hands-on development capability, able to take a product from concept to fully functional reality. Skilled in user research, wireframing, and high-fidelity prototyping \(Figma\), with the added ability to build and ship real, working products using modern no-code and AI-assisted development tools \(e.g., Webflow, Bubble, Frame.io, Lovable\). Bridges the traditional gap between design and development, allowing for faster iteration, more accurate prototypes, and reduced handoff friction with engineering teams.)
